flowchart LR
  GIT[(baselines/*.yaml)] --> N1[Normalize intent]
  AG[Host agent / FIM report] --> N2[Normalize actual]
  N1 --> CMP{Diff}
  N2 --> CMP
  CMP -->|equal| OK[COMPLIANT]
  CMP -->|differs| CLS[Classify: COSMETIC · OPERATIONAL · SECURITY · CRITICAL]
  CLS --> M{Maintenance active?}
  M -->|yes| EXP[EXPECTED - review when window ends]
  M -->|no| INC[Incident for SECURITY / CRITICAL]
  INC --> DEC[Decision engine]
  CLS --> DEC
  DEC --> TX[Restore baseline transaction] --> VER[Checksum = intent?] --> DONE[REMEDIATED]
